82895.sol:
When the spring joined in series the total extension of spring is:
$$
\begin{aligned}
& \Rightarrow y=y_1+y_2=\frac{-F}{k_1}-\frac{F}{k_2} \\
& \Rightarrow \quad y=-\mathrm{F}\left[\frac{1}{k_1}+\frac{1}{k_2}\right] \\
& \therefore \text{ Spring constant } k=\frac{k_1 k_2}{k_1+k_2}
\end{aligned}
$$

